sequenceDiagram
    participant EH as Event Handler
    participant ES as EmbeddingService
    participant EC as EmbeddingClient
    participant QS as QdrantService
    participant VLLM as vLLM Server
    participant Q as Qdrant DB

    Note over EH: Receives ParsedTex with chunks
    loop For each chunk in ParsedTex
        EH->>ES: save_chunk(chunk)
        ES->>EC: embed_chunk(chunk)
        EC->>VLLM: POST /v1/embeddings (text)
        VLLM-->>EC: Embedding response
        EC-->>ES: Embedding
        ES->>QS: save_chunk(chunk, embedding)
        QS->>Q: Upsert point (vector + payload)
        Q-->>QS: Success
        QS-->>ES: OK
        ES-->>EH: OK
    end